## 3. **STORAGE UPLOAD ENDPOINT** (`/api/storage/upload.ts`)

This handles the actual file upload:

```typescript
// Lines 62-119
const form = new IncomingForm({
  maxFileSize: 50 * 1024 * 1024,  // 50MB limit
  keepExtensions: true,
});

// Validate magic bytes (file type security)
function validateMagicBytes(buffer: Buffer, mimeType: string): boolean {
  const signatures = ALLOWED_TYPES[mimeType];
  if (!signatures) return false;
  if (signatures.length === 0) return true;
  return signatures.some(sig =>
    sig.every((byte, i) => buffer.length > i && buffer[i] === byte)
  );
}

// Extract type & category from form fields
const type = Array.isArray(fields.type) ? fields.type[0] : fields.type;     // 'pipeline'
const category = Array.isArray(fields.category) ? fields.category[0] : fields.category;  // 'approval-documents'

// Get file and validate
const file = Array.isArray(fileField) ? fileField[0] : fileField;
const buffer = await fs.promises.readFile(file.filepath);

// Validate MIME type
if (!validateMagicBytes(buffer, mimeType)) {
  throw new Error('File type not allowed');
}

// Upload to VF Storage or local
const result = await vfStorage.uploadFile(buffer, type, category, filename);

// Response
return res.status(200).json({
  success: true,
  url: result.url,       // Public HTTPS URL
  path: result.path,     // Relative path
  fileName: result.fileName,
});
```

**Allowed file types** (lines 18-28):
- `image/jpeg`, `image/png`, `image/gif`, `image/webp`
- `application/pdf`
- `application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet` (xlsx)
- `application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document` (docx)
- `application/msword` (doc)
- `text/csv`

